WEBVTT

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.190
In celebration of the start 
of the Toriko anime...

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:53.290
The Toriko...

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.290
And One Piece...

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.590
Collaboration Special!

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.900
To celebrate the super-popular 
Shonen Jump series,

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:05.600
Toriko, becoming an anime...

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.070
Today's episode is a special collaboration 
between Toriko and One Piece!

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:09.770
So...

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.880
Stick around until the end and enjoy!

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:22.520
What?!

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.160
W-We're out of food?!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.420
Yeah. The stores are empty.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.990
Don't give us that!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.090
You're the cook!

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.060
You're supposed to manage our food supplies!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:33.700
I'm disappointed in you!

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.370
You let me down!

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.940
Hey, you're the ones who snarfed it all down.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.510
This sucks!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.710
First we get thrown by a 
storm into unknown waters,

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.210
and now we're out of food?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:49.350
Anyway, we'll have to stop 
somewhere and stock up.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.420
But are we gonna find a place with 
food to stock up on that easily?

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:54.690
Hey, what's that?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:10.470
Arrival on the Gourmet Island! 
The Gourmet Hunter Toriko Appears!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:20.750
Islands in the south are so warm...

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.580
Food...

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.990
Where's the food?

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:30.390
I was thinking we'd shop 
for food in some town.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.120
That was stupid of me.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.960
There's not a single person 
in sight, let alone a town.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.600
Looks like an uninhabited island.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:40.870
Nami-san, we don't know what might 
pop out at us, so stick close to me.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.500
What? Something's gonna pop out?

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:48.170
I should've stayed on the Sunny 
with Zoro and Usopp and the rest...

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.810
Luffy?

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.010
M—

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.910
Meat!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.620
A meat tree?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.060
It's good! Just like real meat!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.200
That's an awfully carnivorous tree.{Z: carnivorous would mean the tree eats meat. This needs to be fixed.}

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.800
Look! This fungus is made of cotton candy!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.070
What?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.370
Yum!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.440
This grass...

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.380
It's al dente pasta that's 
been boiled perfectly.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.910
What the heck is this island?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.850
Well, it looks like there's plenty 
of food we can stock up on.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.190
What's that?

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.330
It's Pseudopyxis depressa,

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:44.500
the plant said to cure any kind of 
stomach pain if you boil and drink it.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.060
I've never seen this before!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.120
Toriko-san, please don't leave me behind!

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.790
Look at this, Komatsu. It's a rare animal!

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.120
This is definitely Hungry-la Island.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.420
It has such strange creatures.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.090
I wonder if it tastes good.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.060
I'll eat it and see!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:24.200
Let go of Chopper!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.940
His arm stretched out?!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.510
What is this guy?!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.260
Luffy!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.960
What are you trying to do with Chopper?!

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:49.990
Huh?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:54.130
Listen here. I found this little guy.

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.530
So he's my prey.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.940
What? Prey?! You're really gonna eat me?!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:00.540
Yep!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:04.280
B-But I taste gross! So gross, 
you wouldn't believe it!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.840
What? You taste gross?!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.510
Well, no point in eating 
something that tastes bad.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.650
Or are you just... Wait...

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.550
You talked?!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.360
H-How can this thing talk?!

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:20.430
Chopper is part of our 
crew! You can't eat him!

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.230
Oh, boy.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:22.530
I'm asking you how he can talk!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:26.930
What is it?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.200
What's that?

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.710
Something smells tasty!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:35.670
What are these guys?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.710
Looks like we wandered into their territory.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:43.720
The Barbecue Pigs' territory.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.390
Awesome! They're walking roasted pigs!

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.090
They're Barbecue Pigs.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.430
They're ferocious pigs that'll cook

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.130
your goose if you intrude in their territory.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.130
Cook your goose?

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.670
They're already cooked themselves!

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.300
I'm scared!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.270
If you feed them herbs and Ghost Truffles,

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.240
they'll be delicious even without seasoning.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.980
But they're Capture Level 1.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.180
Capture Level?

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:15.750
Yes. It's a scale ranking the difficulty 
of capturing different animals,

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.120
established by the IGO, 
the International Gourmet Organization.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.490
Capture Level 1 means it takes 
ten professional Hunters

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.420
with shotguns just to bring it down.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:25.420
Capture Level 1

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.930
Barbecue Pig (Mammal Beast) Capture Level 1

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.970
For Toriko-san, the Capture 
Level isn't too high,

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.270
but with this many of them, we're in trouble!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.740
Doesn't look that way.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.170
They look tasty!

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.470
Barbecue Pigs, huh?

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:44.810
Food you eat as-is would make any cook cry.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.840
I can't forgive that.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.610
That's what you have a problem with?!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.290
Now let's eat!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.170
What is that smell?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.670
Smells like burning!

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.410
Don't make them angry!

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.420
That makes them heat up and 
burns their delicious meat!

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.250
Finish them in one blow!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.090
Okay!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:35.590
He knows a lot about animals.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:37.160
Not exactly animals...

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.630
He knows a lot about ingredients.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.530
Because Toriko-san is a Gourmet Hunter.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.540
What's a Gourmet Hunter?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.700
A Gourmet Hunter is...

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:49.040
a food researcher who

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.810
seeks and eats ingredients 
still unknown to the world,

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.580
in search of new flavors.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.910
Toriko-san is a star Gourmet Hunter who

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:58.580
has discovered about 6,000 ingredients,

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.820
2% of the total 300,000 in the world.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.360
He's pretty amazing!

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:11.030
I've been wondering all this time.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.400
Your body is like gum, isn't it?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.830
Yeah, because I ate the Gum-Gum Fruit.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.570
Gum-Gum Fruit?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.070
What does that taste like?

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.510
Is it good?

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.870
Nah.

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.010
It was disgusting.

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:26.080
Aww, it was?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:26.810
Yep.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.650
No helping that, then!

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:30.920
Guess not!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.520
Uh, does it even matter 
what those taste like?

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.160
So... hungry...

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.830
Isn't Luffy back yet?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.200
He's taking quite a while.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.770
You think he got lost somewhere?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.540
I guess I should go look for him.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.370
Zoro! Don't go! It'll just 
mess everything up more!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.440
Let's eat!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.160
Yum!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.790
Barbecue Pigs...

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.930
The sweet, top-grade fat 
dripping from the meat...

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.230
The appetizing fragrance of these herbs...

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.260
Delectable!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:22.170
It's thanks to you that we get to 
eat food this delicious, Toriko!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.170
Thank you!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.940
Your name's Terry Cloth, huh?

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:28.110
I'm Chopper. Nice to meet you!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:29.940
Really?

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.180
Terry actually trusts you.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:35.310
You sure are interesting.

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:37.480
That's a Battle Wolf.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:39.750
He almost never takes to strangers.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.020
Sorry I tried to eat you before.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.150
It's okay now.

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.090
I got to be friends with him, anyway.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.730
Still, I never expected to 
be attacked by roasted pigs.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:50.700
Just how surreal is this island?

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.330
This is Hungry-la Island, after all.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.530
Hungry-la Island?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.940
Hungry-la Island is said to be 
abundant in all kinds of ingredients.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.840
It was once thought to be just a legend.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.110
That's where we are?

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:04.840
Yes.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:08.910
How did you find this tiny 
island in the huge sea?

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:13.180
Well, as we were sailing along, 
I caught the scent of tasty food.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.590
And I found it.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.550
What kind of nose do you have?

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:18.560
Nami-san!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.030
I prepared some Barbecue Pig meat for you!

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.200
The best part is Sanji's special sauce,

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.300
made from the abundant 
ingredients of the forest.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:29.270
The elegant aroma brings out 
the Barbecue Pig's flavor...

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.140
Yum!

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:36.240
Luffy! I made that for Nami-san to—

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.210
You're a genius cook.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:41.710
Why did you guys have to eat it?!

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:42.650
Pardon me.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:44.850
What, you, too?!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.950
What delicious sauce!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.960
I'm impressed that you can 
make a sauce this delicious!

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:56.130
Uh, when you compliment me straight-up 
like that, it's kinda embarrassing...

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.300
The faint aroma and acidity 
of citrus is amazing.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.300
I've got it!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.600
You made this with Surprise 
Orange juice, right?!

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.240
Huh? You can tell?

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.800
I'm a bit of a chef myself, after all...

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.540
He noticed the one tiny drop

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.940
of Surprise Orange juice I 
used as a secret seasoning...

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.680
What's with his sense of taste?

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:17.550
Um, I'm embarrassed to ask after 
tasting that sauce, but...

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:20.050
If you don't mind, would you taste this?

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.420
Hm? Sure.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.820
That's good!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.320
The full-bodied flavor, 
the perfect amount of salt...

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.990
Hey, you do pretty good work.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:30.930
Thank you!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:34.000
Well, we've gathered up enough food.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.370
Let's head back to the Sunny.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.670
Hey! Where are the Barbecue Pigs?!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:38.900
They were tasty.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.370
You didn't have to eat all of them!

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:43.240
I swear, you always...

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:45.910
Thank you for this excellent meal.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:48.810
Man! I was gonna take it back to the ship!

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:50.080
What's the problem?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.780
There's plenty of food around here.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:55.820
If you need food, I know just the thing.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.430
The Hungry-la Bird.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.700
Hungry-la Bird?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.870
Yeah. The legendary ingredient, 
the Hungry-la Bird.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:19.080
It's what we came to this island to catch.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:23.720
Of course, if we're up against that, 
there's no guarantee we'll survive.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.150
But its meat dissolves the 
second it hits your tongue,

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.620
and its rich sweetness and indescribable 
aroma are world-famous.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.320
Complex and full of variety,

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:36.230
its flavor that captivates all 
who eat it and never lets them go

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:40.830
gave birth to the saying, 
"All flavors lead to Hungry-la."

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.100
They say one person who ate it once 
and couldn't forget its flavor

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:48.740
found himself swimming across the 
ocean to look for this island.

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.410
The Hungry-la Bird?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.010
It must taste amazing!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.210
Yeah, just imagining it...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.080
...makes me hungry!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.550
What kind of stomachs do you guys have?!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:05.160
The legendary Hungry-la Bird

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.990
might be worthy of my Full Course Meal.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:08.930
Your what?

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.800
Toriko-san is working on his 
life's Full Course Meal,

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:14.200
from the hors d'oeuvre to dessert.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:17.570
I'd love to eat your full course, Toriko!

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:20.570
I haven't figured any of it out yet, though.

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:24.880
But how do you know the Hungry-la 
Bird is at the top of the mountain?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.380
Just look. Plants on Hungry-la 
Island grow very quickly.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:32.880
But there's not a single blade 
of grass on the mountaintop.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.620
That means something with 
an appetite big enough

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.960
to eat the plants before they can grow,

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:41.790
the legendary Hungry-la Bird, must be there.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.630
I get it!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.800
This isn't good.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:54.910
What are these guys?

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:01.510
What are these guys?!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.650
Uni-horn Bears.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:07.220
Uni-horn Bear (Mammal Beast) Capture Level 2

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.890
You want a fight, huh?

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.820
Gum-Gum—

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:11.520
Don't bother.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.660
Their meat is tough and not worth eating.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:15.730
Huh?

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.630
So...

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.060
We run!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.470
Huh?!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:31.340
Hey! Take them all out like you did earlier!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:35.180
I don't take the life of 
anything I don't intend to eat.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.520
That's my rule!

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:39.580
Is that so?

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.420
Then we better run with all our might!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.630
Gum-Gum...

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.530
Stamp!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.280
Chopper! Nami!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:16.750
Is that...

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.420
What is it?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.560
This intimidating presence... 
There's no doubt.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.030
This is the Hungry-la Bird!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.900
Hungry-la Bird (Bird Beast) Capture Level 3

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:00.970
Nami-san!

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.370
Hey, you stupid dog!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.200
Take that!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.710
Sanji!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.110
Heavy Point!

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:16.080
Chopper!

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.320
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.920
That thing's hard!

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.690
It's like it's wearing steel armor!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.600
Here it comes!

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:43.370
Sure is fast for a creature 
wearing steel armor!

00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:59.820
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.660
It's so hard because those 
feathers cover its whole body.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:08.200
But the fact that it's covered 
so well with such tough armor

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:12.640
means the meat hidden inside is 
just that tender and delicious!

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.540
I get it!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:19.980
Still, with it flying around like 
that, we have no way to attack.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.250
We just need to bring it down, right?

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:21.980
Huh?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:23.880
Yeah! Leave it to me!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:31.390
Gum-Gum...

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:34.690
Gatling!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.070
Not bad.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.470
We did it!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.670
No, the attack didn't hurt it.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.880
Hungry-la Bird,

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.680
to demonstrate my respect to you...

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:55.950
What now?

00:18:56.350 --> 00:19:00.920
I shall show you the weapons of a human!

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:10.700
A metallic sound?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.640
I give thanks for all this world's bounty.

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.540
Now let's eat!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.430
Fork!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.430
Knife!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.340
Not bad.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.840
Wow!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.610
Way to go, Toriko-san!

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.220
Thank you for this excellent meal.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.100
Yum!

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:24.770
This fragrant skin is crispy 
beyond description...

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:30.010
And the meat beneath it, dripping 
with juice like top-grade wagyu beef,

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:33.010
dissolves the instant it hits my tongue...

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:37.320
Just like fatty tuna sushi 
of the highest quality!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:40.520
It's delicious!

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.450
More coming your way!

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:45.260
I'm getting great broth for the soup, too.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.190
It smells good!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:50.600
It's delicious!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.560
This is the greatest!

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.600
Yeah, we got to eat all kinds 
of good stuff, thanks to you!

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.800
What are you saying?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.940
It's because you were all 
with me that I got to

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.440
eat this Hungry-la Bird, Luffy.

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:06.710
Since it's so delicious,

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.580
it'll be part of your full course, right?

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.520
Yeah, that's the thing...

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.920
What? Wasn't it a legendary ingredient?

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.860
I'm not saying it wasn't incredible.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:21.630
But there are still lots of 
tasty foods in this world.

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.000
It wouldn't be right to rush a decision.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.160
Come on, let's keep the party going!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:26.860
Yeah!

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:36.910
So... hungry...

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:40.980
I'm so hungry, I think my stomach 
and back are about to fuse together.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:46.580
And I don't even have a stomach or a back!

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:57.200
There we go...

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.880
Now this goes in...

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:03.160
Hey, could I get some more soup?

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:06.540
Sure. Just a moment, please.

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:10.870
Here we go...

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:12.170
What's that?

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:17.230
They're spice seeds. I picked them up earlier.

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:21.890
When I put these in, the spices take effect and change the soup's flavor.

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:54.050
Wasn't the adventure Luffy and I had amazing?

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:56.520
Next week, I'm off to capture a Gararagator!

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.690
That's not a gator! It's a dinosaur!

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:01.590
It's gigantic and fierce 
and it's 300 years old!

00:23:01.590 --> 00:23:02.690
300 years old, eh?

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:05.160
I bet its meat is perfectly 
aged and delicious!

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.370
How can you be so relaxed?!

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:09.630
I'd better go write my will...

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:10.670
Next time on Toriko,

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:14.240
“The Undiscovered Giant Beast! 
Toriko, Capture a Gararagator!”

00:23:14.670 --> 00:23:16.940
Now, let's eat this still-unknown ingredient!

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.940
My adventures with Luffy 
are still continuing.

00:23:22.950 --> 00:23:25.020
Keep the channel right here.
